{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーこクッキング!⑤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、カッテージチーズとバターを作ろうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"用意するもの。\n～バター～生クリーム氷試食用のクラッカーなど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～カッテージチーズ～牛乳レモン\nのみです。\nとても簡単に、手作りのバターとチーズができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作り方。\n～バター～\nボールに生クリームを入れます。\n下のボールには氷水が入っています。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2FG9N933G61JFBTC50YJD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生クリームをとにかく泡立てます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうすると、生クリームは水が分離し、気泡が壊れてバターができてきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約3分混ぜると、、、。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2FHQSVX4DRNX7WESNXSNJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n生クリーム状です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこから、気合で混ぜますo(`･ω´･+o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2FM0G0KGWA8Y8BEWPXAVR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無添加バターの完成!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～カッテージチーズ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湯せんで牛乳を温めます。その中に、レモン汁を加えます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2FNKY1CZAE7C30FFKQF9Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n牛乳に酸(レモン汁)を加えると凝固します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じに、分離してきます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2FQE3WXFFMJBQVA92PZ5A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絞ります。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2FSQA2BFQ2PMQ6GCZKKTD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"開けると、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2FXWSQXMY2XDHMRKJBH3Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n固まりました。\n1口チーズのようです 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラッカーにつけて食べました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2FZCJ7GZJ24GQ5XMS8B3Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無添加!という味がして油こくなくて、市販のものよりも私の好みの味でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手作りバターで、お菓子作りをしてみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっこり。。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2G1AMSZ29PZ0KE96YFZNP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n豆乳はちみつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}